Project Name: Rat-bot
Platform: Android Application (Auto-Restarting Telegram Bot Administration Engine)

================================================================================
PROJECT DESCRIPTION & CAPABILITIES
================================================================================
Rat-bot is an advanced Android application engineered with auto-restart/persistence 
mechanisms and controlled remotely via a Telegram Bot interface.

Supported Features & Commands:

-- Info --
  /info             - Retrieve detailed device specifications
  /online           - Ping execution and connectivity verification
  /battery          - Check current battery status and health

-- Location: GPS --
  /location_gps     - Capture precise GPS coordinates (35-second acquisition cycle)

-- Location: Network --
  /location_net     - Capture cellular/network-based location (35-second acquisition cycle)

-- Location: History --
  /location_history - Retrieve last saved location fix (GPS prioritized)

-- SMS Engine --
  /sms_dump         - Fetch the last 25 SMS messages
  /sms_send <num>|<text> - Dispatch SMS message to specified target

-- Call Logs --
  /call_log         - Fetch the last 25 call history entries

-- Contact Management --
  /contacts         - Dump all stored contacts
  /contacts_add <name>|<num> - Insert new contact entry
  /contacts_del <num>        - Remove specified contact entry

-- System Operations --
  /notifications    - Dump the last 25 notification threads
  /open_url <url>   - Launch specified URL in target browser
  /apps             - Enumerate all installed packages

-- Application State Control --
  /hide             - Suppress/hide application launcher icon
  /show             - Restore application launcher icon
  /status           - Verify current runtime application state

